rce src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962130/extras/42ff82afbcb1af8c59f4036be82ae3f8.webm?t=1662637316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962130/extras/42ff82afbcb1af8c59f4036be82ae3f8.mp4?t=1662637316\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
